  "notes": "Material 3 tonal palette (teal #006a6a primary, neutral-variant surfaces) with no shadows: a single large #f2f5f4 rounded (12px) panel holds every section; member/invite rows are #ecefee 8px-radius strips. Pill buttons (9999px) — filled teal for Save/Invite, outlined for Delete; secondary actions are teal text buttons. Header icon nav sits in a light pill group. The Recent activity section is unusually long, rendered as default browser disc/circle bullets with raw notes (one shows unescaped '&gt;'), giving an unfinished, developer-built feel. Delete uses a pink (#ffdad6-like) inline confirm bar (seen only live). Copy is plain-language ('Who may do what', 'Hand over the group', 'Tell me about'). Permission model is two-layer: group-wide policy selects plus per-member 'Can' overrides ('Whatever the group allows', 'Read only', 'Only their own items', 'Add but not remove')."
